    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can throw a bottle of Erumpent Potion at a point up to 60 feet away, releasing a violent explosion and shockwave. Each creature within 10 feet of that point must make a DC 14 Dexterity saving throw, taking 10d6 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Each creature within 30 feet of that point takes 4d8 thunder damage. This potion is highly volatile and will explode if it is poured out of its container.</p>",
